  "content": "\n\n===== FILE: index.html =====\n<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<title>家味餐厅 - 杭州的家庭美食之地</title>\n<meta name=\"description\" content=\"家味餐厅，位于杭州，提供地道的浙江菜。欢迎本地家庭、上班族和游客来品尝我们的美食。\">\n<style>\n    body { font-family: Arial, sans-serif; margin: 0; padding: 0; }\n    header { background: url('header-bg.jpg') no-repeat center center; background-size: cover; height: 400px; }\n    .container { width: 1440px; margin: auto; }\n    nav { background: #333; color: #fff; padding: 20px 0; }\n    nav ul { list-style-type: none; padding: 0; }\n    nav ul li { display: inline-block; margin-right: 20px; }\n    nav ul li a { color: #fff; text-decoration: none; }\n    .hero-text { text-align: center; padding: 50px; }\n    .hero-text h1 { margin: 0; }\n    .menu-list { margin: 20px 0; }\n    .menu-item { margin-bottom: 20px; }\n    .menu-item h3 { font-size: 1.5em; }\n    .menu-item p { margin: 0; }\n    footer { background: #333; color: #fff; text-align: center; padding: 20px 0; }\n    @media (max-width: 1440px) {\n        .container { width: 90%; }\n    }\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<header>\n    <div class=\"container\">\n        <nav>\n            <ul>\n                <li><a href=\"index.html\">首页</a></li>\n                <li><a href=\"menu.html\">菜单</a></li>\n                <li><a href=\"about.html\">关于我们</a></li>\n                <li><a href=\"reservation.html\">订座</a></li>\n            </ul>\n        </nav>\n        <div class=\"hero-text\">\n            <h1>欢迎光临家味餐厅</h1>\n            <p>杭州本地家庭的首选餐厅</p>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n</header>\n<div class=\"container\">\n    <div class=\"menu-list\">\n        <div class=\"menu-item\">\n            <h3>宫保鸡丁</h3>\n            <p>58元/份</p>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"menu-item\">\n            <h3>东坡肉</h3>\n            <p>88元/份</p>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"menu-item\">\n            <h3>龙井虾仁</h3>\n            <p>78元/份</p>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n</div>\n<footer>\n    <p>家味餐厅 &copy; 2023</p>\n</footer>\n</body>\n</html>\n===== FILE: menu.html =====\n<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<title>家味餐厅 - 菜单</title>\n<meta name=\"description\" content=\"家味餐厅的菜单，提供多款浙江美食。\">\n<link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"styles.css\">\n</head>\n<body>\n<header>\n    <div class=\"container\">\n        <nav>\n            <ul>\n                <li><a href=\"index.html\">首页</a></li>\n                <li><a href=\"menu.html\">菜单</a></li>\n                <li><a href=\"about.html\">关于我们</a></li>\n                <li><a href=\"reservation.html\">订座</a></li>\n            </ul>\n        </nav>\n        <h1>家味餐厅菜单</h1>\n    </div>\n</header>\n<div class=\"container\">\n    <div class=\"menu-list\">\n        <h3>热销菜品</h3>\n        <div class=\"menu-item\">\n            <h3>宫保鸡丁</h3>\n            <p>58元/份</p>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"menu-item\">\n            <h3>东坡肉</h3>\n            <p>88元/份</p>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"menu-item\">\n            <h3>龙井虾仁</h3>\n            <p>78元/份</p>\n        </div>\n        <h3>经典小吃</h3>\n        <div class=\"menu-item\">\n            <h3>臭豆腐</h3>\n            <p>38元/份</p>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"menu-item\">\n            <h3>糖醋排骨</h3>\n            <p>68元/份</p>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"menu-item\">\n            <h3>酱鸭</h3>\n            <p>58元/份</p>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n</div>\n<footer>\n    <p>家味餐厅 &copy; 2023</p>\n</footer>\n</body>\n</html>\n===== FILE: about.html =====\n<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<title>家味餐厅 - 关于我们</title>\n<meta name=\"description\" content=\"家味餐厅的故事和历史。\">\n<link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"styles.css\">\n</head>\n<body>\n<header>\n    <div class=\"container\">\n        <nav>\n            <ul>\n                <li><a href=\"index.html\">首页</a></li>\n                <li><a href=\"menu.html\">菜单</a></li>\n                <li><a href=\"about.html\">关于我们</a></li>\n                <li><a href=\"reservation.html\">订座</a></li>\n            </ul>\n        </nav>\n        <h1>关于家味餐厅</h1>\n    </div>\n</header>\n<div class=\"container\">\n    <div>\n        <h2>我们的故事</h2>\n        <p>家味餐厅成立于1980年，是杭州本地一家历史悠久的家庭餐厅。我们致力于提供正宗的浙江菜，让每一位顾客都能在家一般的温馨氛围中享受美食。</p>\n        <h2>我们的承诺</h2>\n        <p>我们承诺使用新鲜食材，坚持传统的烹饪方法，保证每一道菜都色香味俱全。我们期待您的光临，让我们共同创造美好的用餐体验。</p>\n    </div>\n</div>\n<footer>\n    <p>家味餐厅 &copy; 2023</p>\n</footer>\n</body>\n</html>\n===== FILE: reservation.html =====\n<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<title>家味餐厅 - 订座</title>\n<meta name=\"description\" content=\"在家味餐厅订座，享受美味的浙江菜。\">\n<link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"styles.css\">\n</head>\n<body>\n<header>\n    <div class=\"container\">\n        <nav>\n            <ul>\n                <li><a href=\"index.html\">首页</a></li>\n                <li><a href=\"menu.html\">菜单</a></li>\n                <li><a href=\"about.html\">关于我们</a></li>\n                <li><a href=\"reservation.html\">订座</a></li>\n            </ul>\n        </nav>\n        <h1>家味餐厅 - 订座</h1>\n    </div>\n</header>\n<div class=\"container\">\n    <div>\n        <h2>订座表单</h2>\n        <form action=\"#\" method=\"post\">\n            <label for=\"name\">姓名:</label>\n            <input type=\"text\" id=\"name\" name=\"name\" required><br><br>\n            <label for=\"phone\">电话:</label>\n            <input type=\"tel\" id=\"phone\" name=\"phone\" required><br><br>\n            <label for=\"date\">日期:</label>\n            <input type=\"date\" id=\"date\" name=\"date\" required><br><br>\n            <label for=\"time\">时间:</label>\n            <input type=\"time\" id=\"time\" name=\"time\" required><br><br>\n            <label for=\"people\">人数:</label>\n            <input type=\"number\" id=\"people\" name=\"people\" min=\"1\" required><br><br>\n            <input type=\"submit\" value=\"提交\">\n        </form>\n    </div>\n</div>\n<footer>\n    <p>家味餐厅 &copy; 2023</p>\n</footer>\n</body>\n</html>"
